comments.content:
The `return ModelManagerLocal::cleanup();` makes the subsequent external manager cleanup unreachable dead code. Since `cleanup()` returns void, remove the `return` so that `_externalManager->cleanup()` is actually executed:

```cpp
ModelManagerLocal::cleanup();
#if defined(BUILD_MATERIAL_EXTERNAL)
    if (_externalManager) {
        _externalManager->cleanup();
    }
#endif
```

